## 9b. Chat flow (реализован v1.5)

```
ChatPage (/chat, /chat/:id)
  ↓
hooks: useChatConversations, useChatMessages, useSendMessage, useEditMessage,
       useDeleteMessage, useChatRealtime, useChatDraft, useTypingIndicator, useSearchMessages
  ↓
ChatApi (CRUD messages, attachments, search, group mgmt, mute, pin, typing)
  ↓
mock/chat.ts + ChatRealtimeService (event emitter)
  ↓
services/chat/{access,messages,validation,realtime,helpers}
```

**Message lifecycle:** send (optimistic + dedup `clientMutationId`) → sent → read; edit (`editedAt`); soft-delete (`deletedAt`); reply (`replyToMessageId`); system messages (`messageType: system`).

**Realtime abstraction:** `ChatRealtimeService.subscribe()` / `.emit()` — события `message.created|updated|deleted|read`, `typing.started|stopped`, `member.joined|left`, `conversation.updated`. Mock: event emitter; PocketBase: PB subscriptions (`realtimePocketbase.ts`).

**Attachments:** upload через `uploadAttachment` + server validation (MIME, size, count); UI preview, image viewer, audio player, drag & drop (desktop).

**Read state:** `ConversationMember.lastReadAt`; unread не считает own messages / deleted / system; global badge через `getTotalUnread`.

**Notifications:** suppress если чат открыт (`setOpenConversation`) или muted (`ConversationMember.muted` / `mutedUntil`).

**Group management:** add/remove members, rename, leave, delete; роли `owner|admin|member` (отдельно от global RBAC).

**Pinned messages:** `Conversation.pinnedMessageIds`; pin/unpin через API; bar в header area.

**Lesson-linked:** `Conversation.metadata.lessonId` → context card в header → `/lessons/:id` (IDOR через `getLesson`).

**Search:** conversations (title, participants) + `searchMessages` (debounced, IDOR-safe).

**Scroll:** cursor pagination; preserve position on load older; `scrollToMessage` + highlight; «Новые сообщения» button.

**Drafts:** `localStorage` key `chatDraft:{conversationId}`.

**Permissions:** `chat:read|send|create|manage_members|delete|delete_message|pin_message`; admin без membership не видит personal chats.

**Cache isolation:** `queryClient.clear()` (`src/app/queryClient.ts`) on login/logout/demoLogin.

**Query keys:** `['conversations', userId]`, `['messages', convId, userId]`, `['chat-unread', userId]`, `['members', convId, userId]`, `['chat-search', userId, query]`.

